      "id": 42,
      "type": "bargauge",
      "title": "Withdrawal state age",
      "description": "pending / signed / broadcast. The SLO is broadcast within 15 minutes of approval, so 900s is the warning line. Age, not count: one withdrawal sitting for six hours matters more than fifty for six seconds.",
